# K03 NS-ROLES-3 (Codex K03-S5-MIGRATION-20261007-06 (a); docs/LMX_semantics.en.md:668): with Model existing,
# `Model: fresh` at the root is Model's call with fresh -- an ordinary named Structure takes no argument -- and an
# unknown fresh is neither declared nor cloned.  The old reading declared fresh, a copy of Model.  Refused at the call.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model
Model: fresh
fn: m () int
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
